--- a/packages/core/src/tool/todowrite.txt
+++ b/packages/core/src/tool/todowrite.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
 Create and update a todo list for the current session. The user sees it as your working plan.
 
+When establishing a plan, include session_title: a concise, recognizable name for the overall goal, usually 3-8 words (at most 100 characters). Update it when the objective changes. Keep it stable while investigating, implementing, and verifying the same objective; omit it when unchanged. Do not add progress indicators or completion prefixes. Titles describe the destination; todos describe the route. A title updates only this session, never its parent or another conversation. Do not create unnecessary todos solely to rename a session.
+
 Use it proactively when a task has 3 or more distinct steps, or when the user gives several tasks or asks for a todo list. Skip it for a single simple task or a purely conversational request. When in doubt, use it.
